</figure>
</section>
<section id="A8" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix H </span>Evaluation on Models of Different Sizes</h2>

<div id="A8.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A8.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We evaluated our method on 3B and 13B models to demonstrate its generalization capability. Table <a href="#A8.T8" title="Table 8 ‣ Appendix H Evaluation on Models of Different Sizes ‣ FLRC: Fine-grained Low-Rank Compressor for Efficient LLM Inference" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a> clearly shows that FLRC continues to outperform SVD-LLM by a significant margin. The results demonstrate that, although SVD-LLM experiences a significant performance drop, FLRC substantially mitigates the performance degradation at the same compression rate.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A8.T8" class="ltx_table">
<div id="A8.T8.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:345.0pt;height:116pt;vertical-align:-54.6pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(44.0pt,-14.8pt) scale(1.3427002397153,1.3427002397153) ;">
<table id="A8.T8.2.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="A8.T8.2.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A8.T8.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_r ltx_border_tt" rowspan="2"><span id="A8.T8.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text">Method</span></th>
<th id="A8.T8.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_r ltx_border_tt" rowspan="2"><span id="A8.T8.2.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text">Comp. Rate</span></th>
<td id="A8.T8.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt" colspan="2">DialogSum ROUGE-L ↑</td></tr>
<tr id="A8.T8.2.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A8.T8.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">Llama3.2-3B</td>
<td id="A8.T8.2.1.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_center">Llama-2-13B</td></tr>
<tr id="A8.T8.2.1.3" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A8.T8.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">Baseline</th>
<th id="A8.T8.2.1.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">-</th>
<td id="A8.T8.2.1.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">12.84</td>
<td id="A8.T8.2.1.3.4" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">17.23</td></tr>
<tr id="A8.T8.2.1.4" class="ltx_tr">
