<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 8: </span>Generative performance comparison on 3B and 13B models (ROUGE-L is expressed as percentages).</figcaption>
</figure>
<div id="A8.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A8.p2.1" class="ltx_p">We also conducted a zero-shot evaluation on the Llama-2-13B model. As shown in Table <a href="#A8.T9" title="Table 9 ‣ Appendix H Evaluation on Models of Different Sizes ‣ FLRC: Fine-grained Low-Rank Compressor for Efficient LLM Inference" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a>, our method consistently outperforms prior approaches across diverse tasks at the same compression rate, highlighting the superiority of FLRC efficacy in preserving models performance.</p>
</div>
