<div id="A8.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A8.p3.1" class="ltx_p">We further evaluated our approach on the Llama-30B model (i.e., models exceeding 20B parameters), as presented in Table <a href="#A8.T10" title="Table 10 ‣ Appendix H Evaluation on Models of Different Sizes ‣ FLRC: Fine-grained Low-Rank Compressor for Efficient LLM Inference" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">10</span></a>. On this larger scale, our method continues to outperform prior techniques at identical compression rates. Moreover, we observe that our technique achieves even greater compression efficiency on larger models, yielding a smaller accuracy drop.</p>
</div>
